<p><span style="font-size:150%;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">DATABASE-LOAD-#832</span></span><br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br />
<strong>THIS PERSONNEL PAGE IS CLASSIFIED TO 5/WORLD_NESS CLEARANCE</strong><br />
<strong>ANY UNAUTHORIZED ACCESS WILL BE LOGGED AND DISCIPLINARY ACTIONS WILL BE TAKEN.</strong><br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br />
<tt>Credentials accepted.</tt><br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">------</span><br />
Welcome, Overseer.<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">------</span><br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br />
The following links are currently <tt>RESTRICTED</tt>. Any attempt to open them without proper clearance will result in severe disciplinary measures.<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Subject&nbsp;Information</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Close</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><a style="font-size: 18px; color: white; text-shadow: 1px 3px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); text-decoration: none;" href="http://scp-int.wikidot.com/niveaux-de-menace-des-objets-scp" target="_blank"><span style="display: inline-block; width: 100%; background-color: red; text-align: center; border: 1px none #000; margin: 1px; padding-top: 8px; padding-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Threat Level:</strong> Red</span></a></p>
<div style="display: inline-block; border:dashed 1px #999999; background:#999999; float:center; width:84%; padding:1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px">
<p style="text-align: center;"><strong>You barked up the wrong tree.</strong></p>
<hr />
<p><strong>DATE:</strong> <span style="color:black">Time doesn't exist.</span></p>
<p><strong>NOTE:</strong> The following file has been corrupted. Information recall will begin shortly.</p>
<hr />
<p>[BEGINNING SUBJECT INFORMATION RECALL&#8230;<span class="blinkbar">[]</span>]</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color:black">&#8230;oh?</span></p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color:black">You want to know more about me?</span></p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color:black">I like your moxie.</span></p>
<hr />
<p style="text-align: center;"><strong>SUBJECT OVERVIEW</strong></p>
<p>Name : Sr Researcher Dr Adams Campbell<br />
Clearance Level : Provisional Level 4<br />
Current Status : Unknown<br />
Place of Residence : [DATA CORRUPTED]</p>
<p>About :<br />
Dr Campbell, the lead of many projects that have been recently shut down, was discharged from Foundation service after proceeding with The Bridgewater Project despite Ethic Committee interference. <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Was also suspended multiple times due to suspected use of unregistered thaumatergic abilities.</span><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-1')">1</a></sup></p>
<p>Despite the use of amnestics as per discharge protocol, Dr Campbell appears to have resurfaced under the alias of 'MoreWorldliness' in multiple chatrooms and servers spreading <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">false</span> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">truthful</span> varying statements about the Foundation and the SCPs contained. Discovered through the I/UNDER webcrawler, efforts are currently being made to locate and contain Dr Campbell, with limited degrees of success.</p>
<p>Activity reported from 'MoreWorldliness' includes;</p>
<ul>
<li><span style="font-size:150%;">Leaking Foundation Secrets</span></li>
<li><span style="font-size:150%;">Excessive Interaction</span></li>
<li><span style="font-size:150%;">Too Many Ideas</span></li>
<li><span style="font-size:150%;">Bad 'Noir'-Style Roleplaying (To the point that we consider it offensive)</span></li>
<li><span style="font-size:150%;">Development of Memetic Images</span></li>
</ul>
<p>No further information has been obtainable thus far and information recovered is most commonly discovered to be false, written by Dr Campbell himself, or corrupted.<br />
[END OF FILE]</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>.</p>
<hr />
<p>Credentials accepted. Welcome back, <span style="color:black">Dr. Campbell</span></p>
<hr />
<p><span style="color:black">Alternatively, you could always listen to me.</span></p>
<p><span style="color:black">I like tea and hot chocolate, not that I'd ever drink them together<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-2')">2</a></sup>. I worked for the Foundation since 1984 and was discharged for an <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/treading-around-the-fuzz">'unethical' experiment</a>. Yea right, they were just looking for an excuse. They always said that I was too investigative.</span></p>
<p><span style="color:black">What's 'unethical' in the Foundation, anyway? We literally send hundreds of people to their deaths every month, not to mention the thousands lost in the field and you're telling me the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/the-old-town-of-bridgewater">mistreatment of three kids</a> is too far?</span></p>
<p><span style="color:black">But whatever, you know? I'll get back at them. One way or another.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size:0.8em;"><span style="color:black"><strong>And my noir is <em>not</em> bad</strong></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">De-Classified&nbsp;Files</a></div>
