<blockquote>
<div style="text-align: center;">
<h4 id="toc0"><span>NOTICE FROM THE FOUNDATION MEMETIC AND ANTI-MEMETIC CONTINGENCY AGENCY.</span></h4>
<p>The following content has shown characteristics consistent with info and cognitohazards. Caution is advised.<br />
&#8212; Alex MacJade, Sr. Researcher, MAMCA</p>
</div>
</blockquote>
<p>[<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/transmission-p1-deepspace">TRANSMISSION-P1-DEEPSPACE</a>] ;<br />
<em>&quot;I remember the day I thought the world ended.&quot;</em></p>
<p>[<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/ideals">Ideals</a>] - ;<br />
<em>&quot;Peace was an unsuccessful focus test with the entire human population as its subject; It was teased and teased until humanity screamed for the teasing to stop.&quot;</em></p>
<p>[<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/treading-around-the-fuzz">Treading around the Fuzz</a>] ;<br />
<em>&quot;It wasn't hard to pay attention to everything when two of your friends had been taken by the pseudo-government.&quot;</em></p>
<p>[<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/the-old-town-of-bridgewater">The Bridgewater Incident</a>] - ;<br />
<em>&quot;Together, a three, may have been considered a gift. None remember their old town of Bridgewater.&quot;</em><br />
(Collaborative piece with <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-north" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4695462); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4695462&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1583033532" alt="Doctor North" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4695462)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-north" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4695462); return false;">Doctor North</a></span>!)</p>
<p>[<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/the-fear-of-infinity">The Fear of Infinity</a>] - ;<br />
<em>&quot;I've been waiting. For what, though? I have not a clue.&quot;</em></p>
<p>[<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/osiris-wentworth-and-his-wonderful-day-at-work">Osiris Wentworth and his Wonderful Day at Work</a>] - ;<br />
<em>&quot;The idea of the Foundation having a Human Resources Department was kind of stupid.&quot;</em></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<hr />
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Webcrawler&nbsp;Files</a></div>
