<blockquote>
<div style="text-align: center;">
<h4 id="toc1"><span>NOTICE FROM THE FOUNDATION MEME AGENCY.</span></h4>
<p>North insisted I made something for him. So, for the Site 19 IRC Chat, you are graced with this.</p>
<p>&#8212; Your friend, MoreWorldliness</p>
</div>
</blockquote>
<p><span style="font-size:150%;"><tt>WELCOME TO THE NORTH CORNER</tt></span></p>
<blockquote>
<p>Oh wow, look, a North!</p>
<p>Do you have the new <a href="/subject-north">North</a><sup>tm</sup>?</p>
<p>North North North North North North North North North North North North<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-3" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-3')">3</a></sup></p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">North is forcing me to write this help</span> <tt>WOW ISN'T NORTH SURE GREAT HUH</tt><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-4" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-4')">4</a></sup></p>
</blockquote>
<p><span style="font-size:150%;"><tt>WELCOME TO THE XILAS CORNER</tt></span></p>
<blockquote>
<p>.<br />
.<br />
.<br />
xilas has no corner.<br />
xilas only consumes.<br />
.<br />
.<br />
.</p>
</blockquote>
